 "body": "<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW3227129 BCX0\"></div>\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW3227129 BCX0\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW3227129 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">On Thursday, July 10, </span></span><a class=\"Hyperlink SCXW3227129 BCX0\" href=\"https://echowater.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun Underlined SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">Echo</span></span></a><span data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> hosted its latest wellness </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">w</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">ebinar</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">,</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> “</span></span><a class=\"Hyperlink SCXW3227129 BCX0\" href=\"https://echo.webinargeek.com/watch/replay/4882839/0f89009d9e4e6893ff12fd927a5ccc4a/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun Underlined SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">Travel with Echo,</span></span></a><span data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">” offering an inside look at how molecular hydrogen can support health, performance, and recovery while traveling. With summer travel in full swing, this </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">timely</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> session resonated with attendees looking for smarter ways to stay hydrated, balanced, and energized—without relying on stimulants or guesswork.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-props='{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335551550\":0,\"335551620\":0,\"335559738\":240,\"335559739\":240}'> </span><span class=\"EOP SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-props='{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335551550\":0,\"335551620\":0,\"335559738\":240,\"335559739\":240}'></span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW3227129 BCX0\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW3227129 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">Led by members of Echo’s science and product team, the </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">webinar</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> explored how the Echo Flask is uniquely suited to meet the physiological demands of modern travel—whether </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">you're</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> catching red-eyes, crossing time zones, or simply managing long, high-stress days away from home.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-props='{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335551550\":0,\"335551620\":0,\"335559738\":240,\"335559739\":240}'> </span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW3227129 BCX0\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW3227129 BCX0\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 3\">What We Covered:</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-props='{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"134245418\":true,\"134245529\":true,\"335551550\":0,\"335551620\":0,\"335559738\":281,\"335559739\":281}'> </span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW3227129 BCX0\">\n<ol class=\"NumberListStyle1 SCXW3227129 BCX0\" role=\"list\" start=\"1\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"%1.\" data-font=\"Times New Roman\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props='{\"335551671\":1,\"335552541\":0,\"335559683\":0,\"335559684\":-1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769242\":[65533,0,46],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"%1.\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}' data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\" class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW3227129 BCX0\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW3227129 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">Travel disrupts cellular balance</span></span></strong><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><strong><span class=\"SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> </span></strong><br class=\"SCXW3227129 BCX0\"></span><span data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">Travel thro</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">ws the </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">body off rhythm—through dehydration, cabin pressure, poor sleep, and time zone changes. These disruptions increase oxidative stress and low-grade </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">inflammation,</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> a combination Echo calls “cellular static.” This internal imbalance can leave travelers feeling foggy, sluggish, and drained. The Echo Flask helps modulate this stress by delivering molecular hydrogen, a compound studied in over </span></span><a class=\"Hyperlink SCXW3227129 BCX0\" href=\"https://hydrogenstudies.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun Underlined SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">1,500 peer-reviewed articles</span></span></a><span data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> for its role in supporting mitochondrial health and cellular recovery.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-props='{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335551550\":0,\"335551620\":0,\"335559738\":240,\"335559739\":240}'> </span></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW3227129 BCX0\">\n<ol class=\"NumberListStyle1 SCXW3227129 BCX0\" role=\"list\" start=\"2\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"%1.\" data-font=\"Times New Roman\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props='{\"335551671\":1,\"335552541\":0,\"335559683\":0,\"335559684\":-1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769242\":[65533,0,46],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"%1.\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}' data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\" class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW3227129 BCX0\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW3227129 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">Hydrogen water as a natural jet lag aid</span></span></strong><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><strong><span class=\"SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> </span></strong><br class=\"SCXW3227129 BCX0\"></span><span data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">The </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">webinar</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> featured a deep dive into how hydrogen-enriched water can help regulate circadian rhythm post-travel. Molecular hydrogen supports homeostasis, the body’s natural drive for balance. By reducing inflammation and oxidative stress, hydrogen water helps the body adapt more quickly to time-zone changes and recover from disrupted sleep.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-props='{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335551550\":0,\"335551620\":0,\"335559738\":240,\"335559739\":240}'> </span></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW3227129 BCX0\">\n<ol class=\"NumberListStyle1 SCXW3227129 BCX0\" role=\"list\" start=\"3\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"%1.\" data-font=\"Times New Roman\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props='{\"335551671\":1,\"335552541\":0,\"335559683\":0,\"335559684\":-1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769242\":[65533,0,46],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"%1.\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}' data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\" class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW3227129 BCX0\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW3227129 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">Smart hydration for real life</span></span></strong><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><strong><span class=\"SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> </span></strong><br class=\"SCXW3227129 BCX0\"></span><span data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">Unlike traditional water bottles, the Echo Flask includes real-time hydrogen performance tracking and mobile app integration. This gives users confidence that </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">they’re</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> getting consistent, measurable benefits—especially valuable when routines are disrupted by travel. The app also encourages habit-building through insights and progress tracking.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-props='{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335551550\":0,\"335551620\":0,\"335559738\":240,\"335559739\":240}'> </span></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ListContainerWrapper SCXW3227129 BCX0\">\n<ol class=\"NumberListStyle1 SCXW3227129 BCX0\" role=\"list\" start=\"4\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"%1.\" data-font=\"Times New Roman\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props='{\"335551671\":1,\"335552541\":0,\"335559683\":0,\"335559684\":-1,\"335559685\":720,\"335559991\":360,\"469769242\":[65533,0,46],\"469777803\":\"left\",\"469777804\":\"%1.\",\"469777815\":\"hybridMultilevel\"}' data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\" class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW3227129 BCX0\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW3227129 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">Energy without the crash</span></span></strong><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><strong><span class=\"SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> </span></strong><br class=\"SCXW3227129 BCX0\"></span><span data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">One of the most valuable insights shared was the difference between stimulant-based energy and true cellular performance. The Echo Flask promotes steady, sustainable energy without relying on caffeine or sugar. It supports the body’s own processes, helping users feel more present and productive wherever they go.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-props='{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335551550\":0,\"335551620\":0,\"335559738\":240,\"335559739\":240}'> </span></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW3227129 BCX0\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW3227129 BCX0\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 3\">A Special Offer and What’s Next</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-props='{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"134245418\":true,\"134245529\":true,\"335551550\":0,\"335551620\":0,\"335559738\":281,\"335559739\":281}'> </span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW3227129 BCX0\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW3227129 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">To thank attendees, </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW3227129 BCX0\">Echo</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> offered a special promotion on the Echo Flask during the session. It was </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">a great opportunity</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> for travelers to upgrade their wellness routine with a high-performance hydration tool designed for mobility, resilience, and everyday use.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-props='{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335551550\":0,\"335551620\":0,\"335559738\":240,\"335559739\":240}'> </span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW3227129 BCX0\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW3227129 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">If you missed the session, you </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW3227129 BCX0\">can</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> still explore how to beat jet lag naturally and discover the science behind hydrogen-infused water at:</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> </span></span><a class=\"Hyperlink SCXW3227129 BCX0\" href=\"https://echo.webinargeek.com/watch/replay/4882839/0f89009d9e4e6893ff12fd927a5ccc4a/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun Underlined SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">https://echo.webinargeek.com/watch/replay/4882839/0f89009d9e4e6893ff12fd927a5ccc4a/</span></span></a><span data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun EmptyTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-props='{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335551550\":0,\"335551620\":0,\"335559738\":240,\"335559739\":240}'> </span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW3227129 BCX0\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW3227129 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">Join us for </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW3227129 BCX0\">Echo’s</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> next </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">webinar</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> on </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">Thursday, July 17 – \"How </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW3227129 BCX0\">Echo</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> Stacks Up\". </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">It will be an</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">infomercial-style breakdown comparing </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW3227129 BCX0\">Echo’s</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"> technology to powders, tablets, and other bottles on the market. Features a blind taste test </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\">and a look at what truly sets Echo apart. Register </span></span><a class=\"Hyperlink SCXW3227129 BCX0\" href=\"https://echowater.com/pages/echo-competition\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun Underlined SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">here</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">.</span></span></a><span data-contrast=\"none\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun EmptyTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-props='{\"134233117\":false,\"134233118\":false,\"335551550\":0,\"335551620\":0,\"335559738\":240,\"335559739\":240}'> </span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW3227129 BCX0\">\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW3227129 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-US\" class=\"TextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW3227129 BCX0\"></span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW3227129 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\"> </span></p>\n</div>",
